This repository continues the TWRP 12.1 device tree history below; the commits
of the earlier authors are kept in git. Files written or changed for this
repository are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE),
like the build files they extend: Android.mk, AndroidProducts.mk,
BoardConfig.mk, device.mk, twrp_gts7xlwifi.mk, vendorsetup.sh,
recovery/root/system/etc/twrp.flags, patch-check.ps1, recovery-inspect.ps1,
release.sh, test-notes.md and README.md. The commits from ddccd95 on are ours.

Their parts keep their own authors and licenses:

