  From the a52sxq and r8q history above, Apache License 2.0.

* prebuilt/Image.gz, prebuilt/dtb, prebuilt/dtbo.img
  Kernel, device tree and recovery DTBO taken from the recovery image of
  LineageOS 24.0 for gts7xlwifi (24.0-20261029-nightly, Linux
  4.19.325-cip136-st20-perf-gad129ac77e9d). The kernel was compressed with
  gzip -9 -n here; no other change. GPL-2.0.
  Source: https://github.com/LineageOS/android_kernel_samsung_sm8250

* recovery/root/system/bin/* (except the two scripts above),
  recovery/root/vendor/lib64/*, recovery/root/vendor/etc/gpfspath_oem_config.xml,
  recovery/root/vendor/etc/init/*
  Proprietary Samsung and Qualcomm vendor files, carried over from the tree
  history above (first added for a52sxq and r8q). These files from the
  LineageOS 24 gts7xlwifi vendor image (sm8250-common blobs, firmware
  G780GXXSHEYJ1) replace or extend them: vendor/lib64/hw/gatekeeper.mdfpp.so,
  vendor/lib64/hw/android.hardware.gatekeeper@1.0-impl-qti.so,
  vendor/lib64/libcrypto-v33.so, vendor/lib64/libhidltransport.so,
  vendor/lib64/libhwbinder.so. They are included unmodified so that the
  recovery can reach the keymaster and gatekeeper. They are not covered by
  this repository's license; all rights remain with their owners.

* Reference only (no files copied)
  Inkypen twrp_gts7xl (Galaxy Tab S7+ 5G, SM-T976B): FBE and metadata
  decryption flags and the default brightness.

